Define ILog behavior/protocol to provide common interface for Log and ScopedLogs.

File to create/modify:
- lib/freyja/effects/effect_logger/log.ex

Add after the module definitions:

```elixir
defprotocol Freyja.Effects.EffectLogger.ILog do
  @moduledoc """
  Common interface for Log and ScopedLogs
  """
  def log_effect(log, impure)
  def push_effect(log, impure)
  def log_interpreted_effect_value(log, value)
  def consume_log_entry(log)
  def prepare_for_retrace(log)
end
```

Note: We may choose to use a behavior instead of a protocol depending on what works better with the pattern matching in the handler.

